WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.912
(Music)

00:00:01.912 --> 00:00:03.832
- Bamboo is a material
I have come to love,

00:00:03.832 --> 00:00:06.043
appreciate, and admire so much.

00:00:06.043 --> 00:00:07.811
Because, whenever I am riding a bike,

00:00:07.811 --> 00:00:09.768
it's unique-nobody has it.

00:00:09.768 --> 00:00:11.642
It's just unique to me.

00:00:11.642 --> 00:00:14.443
So, you get a lot of attention
whilst riding a bamboo bike.

00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:17.026
(Upbeat Music)

00:00:27.373 --> 00:00:29.312
- My name is Kwabena Danso.

00:00:29.312 --> 00:00:31.322
I am the founder and CEO
of Booomers International-

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:34.211
a company that manufactures
bamboo bicycles and accessories

00:00:34.211 --> 00:00:36.233
in rural Ghana.

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:37.941
So, Booomers is a social enterprise

00:00:37.941 --> 00:00:41.072
that actually trains young
people in rural communities

00:00:41.072 --> 00:00:44.632
and employ them to make bamboo
bicycles and accessories.

00:00:44.632 --> 00:00:46.642
So, we make different
products from bamboo,

00:00:46.642 --> 00:00:49.003
using mostly school
dropouts who couldn't have

00:00:49.003 --> 00:00:50.752
had the opportunity to go back to school

00:00:50.752 --> 00:00:52.122
and wouldn't have had the opportunity

00:00:52.122 --> 00:00:54.672
to go to get former employment.

00:00:54.672 --> 00:00:57.158
(Bell Dings)

00:00:57.158 --> 00:00:58.648
We have different types of bicycles.

00:00:58.648 --> 00:01:01.229
City bikes, mountain bikes, road bikes,

00:01:01.229 --> 00:01:03.316
and we also do tricycles for kids.

00:01:03.316 --> 00:01:04.544
(Upbeat Music)

00:01:04.544 --> 00:01:06.716
For everything that normal wood would do,

00:01:06.716 --> 00:01:07.975
bamboo would do that.

00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:09.785
Almost everything that a steel would do,

00:01:09.785 --> 00:01:10.847
bamboo would do that.

00:01:10.847 --> 00:01:12.086
Because bamboo is actually the

00:01:12.086 --> 00:01:13.896
strongest plant you can ever find

00:01:13.896 --> 00:01:16.545
because of the way the
fiber has been created.

00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:18.905
This is what made the
bamboo bicycle unique,

00:01:18.905 --> 00:01:20.537
and people appreciate it so much.

00:01:20.537 --> 00:01:22.442
(Upbeat Music)

00:01:22.442 --> 00:01:24.797
Currently, we have about
40 employees directly

00:01:24.797 --> 00:01:25.630
and we also employ
another 20 indirectly, who

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:26.463
do the harvesting-the fiber
that we use for the wrapping.

00:01:31.535 --> 00:01:34.204
We're engaging about
200 farmers to go into

00:01:34.204 --> 00:01:35.954
bamboo agro forestry.

00:01:36.874 --> 00:01:39.306
Each worker receives a very good wage,

00:01:39.306 --> 00:01:40.815
and then we also pay for
their social security.

00:01:40.815 --> 00:01:43.933
And this should empower them and

00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:45.794
should be able to make them happy

00:01:45.794 --> 00:01:47.135
and that's why you come to the factory,

00:01:47.135 --> 00:01:49.866
and all the guys are always
happy doing what they are doing,

00:01:49.866 --> 00:01:52.839
because we live like a family.

00:01:52.839 --> 00:01:54.550
(Bamboo Falling)

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.070
(Piano Music)

00:01:56.070 --> 00:02:00.452
Between 2014, when we started
going commercial, and 2018,

00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:04.437
we've sold almost about 4,000
bicycles internationally.

00:02:04.437 --> 00:02:07.239
The goal is to produce between
5,000 and 6,000 bicycles

00:02:07.239 --> 00:02:08.956
a year, which translates to about

00:02:08.956 --> 00:02:10.811
500 bicycles a month.

00:02:10.811 --> 00:02:12.094
(Bamboo Scraping)

00:02:12.094 --> 00:02:14.447
My favorite part of the job

00:02:14.447 --> 00:02:16.947
is waking up every morning and

00:02:17.827 --> 00:02:21.257
realizing that you're not
just thinking about yourself,

00:02:21.257 --> 00:02:23.867
but you're thinking about
the entire community.

00:02:23.867 --> 00:02:25.715
How to make the community better.

00:02:25.715 --> 00:02:29.734
How to empower young people
to empower themselves.

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:31.984
(laughter)

